--------------------------------------------------------------------------
NO REDISTRIBUTED DATASET
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Unlike its sibling projects in this program, answerbank does not derive
from, redistribute, or repackage any third-party dataset. The library it
manages contains text written by its users about their own organizations.

The starter templates in templates/ are original work by the authors of
this project, released under the Apache License 2.0 along with the rest of
the repository. Their structure reflects long-standing conventions in the
grant profession and, where a section ordering is traceable to a published
government form, that form is cited in docs/research/data-sources.md. U.S.
federal forms in the SF-424 family are works of the United States
Government and are not subject to copyright protection in the United
States (17 U.S.C. sec. 105).

